We further report that during the course of our audit it has come to our notice that there has been a financial fraud by one of the employees of the company wherein he was receiving kickbacks from one of the vendors of the Company. The amount involved was Rs. 96,80,860.00, which has been established after an independent fact-finding review conducted by the Company through an Independent Agency. We had intimated about this fraud to the audit committee of the company as per Section 143(12) of the Companies Act,2013. As per the reply received from the Audit Committee of the Company , it has recovered the entire amount from the employee. The employee has paid Rs. 87,76,927.00 and Rs. 9,03,333.00 was adjusted from his Full and Final settlement. The Audit committee has further informed that the employee was officially separated from employment with effect from 10th April 2026 and the alleged vendor and its related entities have been blacklisted.

